Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sullivan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.62,0:00:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.28,0:00:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He was our last champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.18,0:00:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And a real man of the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,When he walked into a bar, he'd shout:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.66,0:00:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,'Anyone want a fight? I'm ready!'
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.74,0:00:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody ever did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And then Sullivan bought the beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, he was a real gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.46,0:00:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.42,0:00:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,To old Sullivan.
